        "notes": "Agenor Linea only, near 142°E and 44°S. Colors encode the released local stereo heights in meters; their relative datum is not a global reference level. Effective detail is about 3 km. Fixed northwest cartographic relief shows slopes; it is not part of the numeric scale. Gray grid preserves the DTM’s finite/no-data footprint. The archive’s duplicated, cubic-resampled quality products are excluded; colors imply no quality class or pointwise accuracy.",
